# Competitive Intelligence Agent

## Setup

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000

## Demo mode (default)

No API keys required. Uses **Demo / Sample Data** for Notion vs Coda / ClickUp / Confluence.

## Live mode (optional)

Create `.env.local`:

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# or
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=...

# optional
OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
TAVILY_API_KEY=...
```

Then select **Live** in the analysis form.
